Subject: [PATCH] Add VAL-088 + VAL-089 glioma-epic v0.1: blood arm + tumor
 tissue arm
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VAL-088 glioma-epic blood arm — Stage 1 immune Xu-538 A-score on GSE180683
Salas/Wiencke 2022 EPIC peripheral blood (n=76 glioma) vs GSE51057 EPIC-Italy
buffy coat healthy reference (n=115). All glioma d=+0.91 [+0.61, +1.22];
pre-surgery treatment-naive subset (n=37) d=+0.94 [+0.56, +1.33].
Outcome: O5_POSITIVE_INVERTED. Bracci 2022 cell-fraction prior predicting
NEGATIVE direction was inverted by direct measurement. Glioma joins
activation-shifted set (AD/breast/lung/prostate/HCC), not suppression-shifted
set (CRC). Cell-fraction direction (NLR-style) and methylation-entropy
direction (Shannon entropy) are different metrics measuring different
phenomena. Revised CCL-023 anchoring set: only pre-dx CRC at 5-10yr reads
NEGATIVE; everything else at-dx reads POSITIVE.

VAL-089 glioma-epic tissue arm — Direct architecture A-score on GSE60274
Lai 2015 brain tissue 450K (n=64 GBM primary + 4 recurrent + 4 spheres
+ 5 NTB on-study controls). GBM primary d=+0.24 [-0.67, +1.15] wide CI
from small NTB n=5 plus 5x variance ratio (heme-LL-008 plasticity).
GBM recurrent d=+1.17 (disease progression amplifies). GBM spheres d=-1.81
NEGATIVE — pure tumor-cell-line beta distributions LESS mixed than
mixed-cell tissue. Validates that Shannon entropy of methylation captures
cell-mixture diversity NOT tumor-cell intrinsic property. A high A-score
is a heterogeneity marker, not a tumor marker.
Outcome: O2_PARTIAL_DIRECTION_CONSISTENT_VARIANCE_HIGH.

Both VALs PASS CCL-032 diagnostic order (data integrity, biology, framework).
